      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZERO DARK THIRTY (8) boasts a strong record this course with two wins and two minors from six tries. Scored by 10 lengths last time (22.97) in a Grade 5 over 400m at this track. Looks a key chance on best form. STAN BY ME (7) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 6 lengths at Wagga in a handy 23.23 beating Silent Edge. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Shapes as a top winning chance on latest effort. URBAN BOY (1) doesn't win out of turn but looks close to breaking through. Continues to race well, filling the minors at the last three starts, the latest when second (30.82) at Gunnedah. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Expected to feature. LIMELIGHT LEVI (2) comes back from a spell as a top three prospect.",
